WEBVTT

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.850
Do not chase the bone. Leave it be.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:20.810
Let his bone wander about freely.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.890
Then, I will combine it
with Jotaro Kujo's memory.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.940
I will learn the truth!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.570
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this green fruit.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:36.200
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.410
What will it spawn?

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.830
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.910
We'll leave you to find its User

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.670
and finish him off.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.040
Fuck…

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.460
Who would have thought that was an attack?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.670
His bodily fluids… He used his spit

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:57.090
to destroy my mouth before I realized it.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.470
He attacked me slowly, little by little.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:02.890
What should I do?

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.020
Should I go after Jolyne's boat?

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.020
No.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:08.020
I will stick to my mission

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.270
and go finish off that Stand's User.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.320
This is the most definite way.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.540
EPISODE 20: F.F. - THE WITNESS

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.540
Hey you.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.960
Head toward that island.

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:05.390
Why are we stopping at this hidden place?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.680
Hey, turn off the engine.
Don't make a sound.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.770
Don't you hear that?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.650
I said hurry up
and turn off the engine, idiot!

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.580
Emergency in the Disciplinary Wing area.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.660
The entire facility
is on Level 4 security.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.960
Stay on high alert!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.800
That's a 12.7mm M2 heavy machine gun.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.920
Its range is 1,000 to 2,000 meters.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.300
A mere graze from that bullet
would blow our limbs off.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.430
This old boat would be shot into pieces.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.060
Hey, shut up.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.980
You're shaking the boat.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.270
Stay away from the steering!

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.150
Stay calm.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:05.820
If they had spotted us,
we would've been shot at.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.950
Ten o'clock.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.540
There was an unusual splashing
by the bushes.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.210
Maybe a fish or an alligator?

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.170
They're coming. We should leave!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.420
Grab the leaves like this, master.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:24.680
I told you to be quiet, dimwit!

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:29.140
No. I'm folding these leaves in half.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.980
Here, let's weave it and rest it here.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.780
Stick them here like this.

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.860
And now, let's paint your face.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:52.450
Excellent.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.750
Good, now let's get your face ready.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.560
Emergency report!

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.430
All guards,
return to the Disciplinary Wing!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.390
I repeat, everyone back to their posts!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.270
Turn back?

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:21.520
I'm not sure what's happening,
but it sounds pretty serious.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:22.440
Let's head back.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.160
Where the hell did these guys come from?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.040
Damn! Turn the engine on, hurry up!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.420
It won't start in time!

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.880
We'll get shot before it gets going!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.590
You there! What have you done
at the Disciplinary Wing?

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.320
Listen! Do not move!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.650
Put your hands on the floor! Stay down!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.570
I said don't move, bastard!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.620
Hit the ground, now!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.330
-Our boat!
-We can take their boat.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.870
And you're doing it for us.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.510
What just hit us?

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.520
I'm taking this boat.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.980
I'm sure you don't mind. Don't get eaten
by alligators on your way back.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.350
Diver Drive!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.980
Jolyne, are the plants
still growing inside you?

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.570
Let's continue heading east.
The sun is still going down.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.080
So mean, tossing me around
like I was a sack…

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.620
Oh, well.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.850
Hey Jolyne, I'm sorry,
but can you stop whistling?

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:22.900
We might hear the guards' boats again.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.860
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING, ANASTASIA?

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.820
ANASTASIA! HEY, CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.740
I can't speak!

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:40.370
ANASTASIA!
MY VOICE! IT'S NOT COMING OUT!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.580
ANASTASIA!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.710
This Stand…

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.010
He's here to do more than
just run off with the green child!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:53.180
He was slowly attacking us!

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.640
What's the matter?

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.970
You are breathing hard.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.980
I feel the same way, Jolyne.

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.400
Can you feel my heart pounding?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:07.270
You are suddenly getting close to me.

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:10.860
Do you finally understand
how I feel for you?

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.910
Not my eyes, my tongue!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.870
Are you at a loss for words?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.080
I know how you feel.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.080
But there's no need for words between us.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:28.880
I feel the same about you.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.590
You're dying to kiss me, right?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:35.550
You want a deep kiss already?

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:45.190
When, and how did he attack us?
I didn't notice at all.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.610
I have to keep him in my sights!

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.360
Jolyne…

00:08:58.910 --> 00:08:59.990
Well, which is it?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.580
Do you want to kiss, or not?

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:07.670
I know, is this a kink?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.800
Like, you are particular about
your kissing angle…

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.630
An auto-tracking Stand.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:19.100
It follows our orders like a slave
and acts docile like a servant.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.720
It pretends to be harmless.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.600
But that's his method.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.310
It's a Stand that strikes

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.690
when its prey lets their guard down!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.400
At this rate, we're both toast.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.200
Bring it on.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.580
Try to attack me.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.120
I must make Anastasia see
what's happening.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.000
YA-YA MA.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:53.590
That's my name.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.260
YA-YA MA.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:59.090
Let me show you how to tan frog hide.
Look here.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:04.930
Rub this mixture made of fat and brains
all creamy and thick

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:08.140
on the back of the frog skin.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:11.560
This smoothes the hide.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.690
If you want, I can go get ten more

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:20.410
and tailor up the coolest
super mini-skirt using their hide.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:25.790
It'll make your legs look ultra-long
and slim, and your hips will look wide!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.210
Jolyne, what is the matter? Seriously.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.290
If a trigger is necessary,

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:35.130
there must be a trigger to his attacks!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.720
And if they're automatic, then…

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.270
This is what I was waiting for.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.400
I covered my skin with my threads
and waited for something to touch it.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.400
His attacks set off automatically
when we turn away.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.110
That's his ability.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:05.370
And now, I know how he attacks.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:06.870
He uses mosquitoes!

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.540
Jolyne, what's going on?

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:15.170
Jolyne!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.760
Was I wrong? Does he not use mosquitoes?

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.970
Or is he attacking in other ways too?

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:27.060
BE ALL EYES
DON'T EVER LOOK AWAY

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.230
You…

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.230
Bastard!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:38.730
Master, you want me
to keep driving this boat?

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:43.820
Or do you want to fight me one-on-one?

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.950
Or will you escape--

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.500
I was wrong. He doesn't use mosquitoes.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.000
He attacks in other ways.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.920
Yes, give me more!

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:04.220
He attacks in a way that
can't be seen by the naked eye!

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:05.220
Run!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:09.680
I do believe this is
your last chance to escape.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.480
I hope you are prepared.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:18.190
Prepared to regret ever being born
in this world.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.950
STAND NAME: DIVER DRIVE
STAND MASTER: NARCISO ANASTASIA

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.780
Go to the back of the boat,
at the corner of the port!

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.250
Take out everything you're hiding.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:40.380
Spread them out by my feet.
Now, show them to me!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:45.050
Two rhino beetles,
a microphone for singing,

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:49.510
low-calorie sugar packs, and three frogs.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:53.430
One raw frog hide, a bundle of broccoli,

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.100
four mock strawberries,
and two used matchsticks.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.400
No, his belongings are irrelevant.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:05.360
We are upwind of him,
yet he is able to attack us.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:11.830
An auto-tracking Stand…
Your target is set, is that right?

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:15.160
Yes sir, my target is absolutely locked on

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.290
to Jolyne Cujoh since
the very first time I touched her.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.380
Your User commanded you to target her.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:26.680
You won't try to escape
until you've finished her off.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.470
YA-YA MA.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:31.890
And if you want to be by her side, master,

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:36.230
I will finish you off along with Jolyne.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:43.980
Could he be using his spit to attack?

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:45.650
YA-YA MA.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.910
You still don't get it, do you?

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:52.450
You can't destroy or stop me, ever.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.160
The only way to survive

00:13:55.250 --> 00:14:00.330
was to run away from me.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.800
This boat… Should I stop it?

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.130
This splattering water…

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:10.430
If the spit he uses to attack

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:13.640
has already permeated
the wetland waters, then…

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.850
Now, stand and go to the driver's seat.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.810
Crank up the speed.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.230
Now get up.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.270
No, you'll make things worse.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:29.240
If you speed up the boat,
the water will splash everywhere.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.950
Yes, if that's what you want, master.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.060
Ribbit!

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:03.690
Jolyne, he stopped attacking
although the boat's speed hadn't changed.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.490
YA-YA MA.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.660
Something's not right…

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.830
Birds! Hide!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.130
Diver Drive.

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:27.550
I don't care how he attacks.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:31.590
Since he is a perfect auto-tracking Stand,

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.680
I buried a frog in his head

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:37.890
and connected its brain
to his tracking sensors.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:42.020
Try to track us as a frog
as long as you exist!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:48.360
Wait… what was I going to do?

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.820
I am an auto-tracking Stand.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:56.280
My mission is to defeat Jolyne Cujoh
and return with the green child.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.330
Oh, dear.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.790
I have no time to be bumming around!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:03.080
I have to spatter my spit
to attack Anastasia!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:05.250
I'll create a static charge
by causing friction

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.130
between the plastic and the propellers.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:10.840
That'll make my spit fly everywhere!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.550
He'll never figure it out!

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:18.510
Oh, but those birds are so scary!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.180
Hide!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:24.140
Ew, I peed myself like those frogs do!

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:29.320
Woah, what a cutie! Look at those curves!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.280
Let me ride you, darling!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.070
Oh, a rhino beetle!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.330
He won't bother us anymore.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:42.330
We need F.F.'s help to heal the wounds.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.830
All we need to do

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.920
is wait for F.F. to finish D an' G off
and meet up with us.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:55.300
What the hell happened
to the Disciplinary Wing?

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:58.350
Where are the guards and the prisoners?

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:00.640
We've only been gone
for around ten minutes!

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:03.560
Where did these plants even come from?

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.600
How do we explain this?

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.230
What is that prisoner's condition?

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.900
Is he able to talk?

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:14.150
Prisoner ME14067, D an' G.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:17.910
He is in critical condition.
His right arm almost got ripped off.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.240
We can't question him.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:26.580
I'll blow his head off for setting loose
a Stand that's creepy as hell.

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:42.180
That man, isn't he
the prison's priest, Father Pucchi?

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.480
What is a priest doing here?

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.850
Shit, forget about him for now.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.780
What's more important
is the definite death of D an' G.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.240
Three hundred fifty-nine.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.910
Three hundred sixty-seven.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.450
Three hundred seventy-three.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:00.990
Three hundred seventy-nine.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.240
Three hundred eighty-three.
Three hundred eighty-nine.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.620
Three hundred ninety-seven.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:08.710
And now, the four hundreds.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.580
First, four hundred one.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.090
Then, four hundred nine.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:16.300
D an' G is gravely injured, meaning…

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:21.050
I must conclude that
Jolyne Cujoh is still alive.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:25.470
And the plethora of withered plants…

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.640
I take it that Dio's bone caused this.

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:31.770
Dio's bone is using the prisoners' bodies

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:36.240
to accomplish something
outside of my imagination.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.490
Splendid.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:38.820
This is wonderful.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.570
So it has finally begun.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.450
I've been waiting for this moment
for 22 years.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.040
What D an' G witnessed here…

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:51.170
I must ask him what he saw, in person!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:57.510
Isn't that right, Survivor's Guccio?
It seems you didn't see what happened,

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.840
but the plants must have set
something in motion.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.550
Doesn't this call for a celebration?

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.390
It will be in my hands soon.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.600
What is true happiness?

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.810
I will attain heaven.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:16.940
Sing praises. The thing that will be born
is heaven itself.

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:21.660
The curtains to the new world have risen.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.170
Splendid…

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.670
Yes, praise this moment!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:42.090
Handel's "Messiah" is a true masterpiece!

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.770
How befitting…

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.020
It's as if the music exudes light.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:57.520
It is said that Handel led this piece
even the day before his own death!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:02.400
All right, leave D an' G to the medics.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.070
Question him after his treatment.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:08.580
We must search for
the other prisoners and guards.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.200
-Now, go.
-Yes, sir.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:21.630
No, I will question him
before he is treated.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:26.390
I must not let
what was conceived get lost!

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.810
Good. Now, start the car.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:29.770
Yes, sir.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.650
That woman…

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:43.360
That face underneath the hat!

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:48.450
You're done now.

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:51.330
Those who control auto-tracking Stands

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.040
are defenseless
when the tables turn on them.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.420
That's the risk you bear!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.380
It's F.F.!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.460
Why are they at this Disciplinary Wing?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.460
Since when? This is bad!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.010
They were after D an' G!

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:08.550
He has a disc!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.640
Pale Snake is nearby!

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.350
Where is he?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.110
Where did he throw the disc from?

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:20.400
Four hundred seventy-nine.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.320
Four hundred eighty-seven.

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.110
Four hundred ninety-one.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.990
Four hundred ninety-nine.

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.370
No way…

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.620
The one who threw it was…

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:32.740
It can't be him!

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:36.330
This is bad. It's very bad for me.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:40.880
You are able to attack D an 'G
here and now

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:46.380
because his Stand
YA-YA MA is tracking Jolyne.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:47.630
Pale Snake's User is…

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:49.850
This can't be!

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:53.720
There are things I must learn from him.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.350
I cannot have him die yet.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.770
So the one who controls Pale Snake is…

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.020
If that's true, then what?

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:04.110
Which do you prioritize?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:05.690
Is it me?

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:09.490
Or is it finishing D an' G?

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:11.030
You are…

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.450
Father Pucchi.

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:15.160
You bastard!

